        "### A3 · Errors vs. extremes\n",
        "Find the impossible values. Store the sorted unique impossible ages as **`impossible_ages`** and the number of rows with negative work hours as **`n_neg_work`**. (Remember: extreme-but-valid values like a long commute are *kept*.)\n",
