    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "26cefbe7",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "26cefbe7"
      },
      "source": [
        "### B5 · Standardize the key & integrate\n",
        "Build one **row-per-student** analysis table called **`analysis`**: start from `students_dedup`, add a standardized numeric key, and merge in a per-student summary of `activity` (e.g., total `minutes_active`).\n",
        "*Hint:* make the key with `.str.replace(\"NU-\",\"\")` → `int`; summarize activity with `groupby(...).sum()`; then `merge`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "4377f853",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "4377f853"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Add standardized 'sid' to students_dedup\n",
        "students_dedup[\"sid\"] = students_dedup[\"student_id\"].str.replace(\"NU-\", \"\").astype(int)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Add standardized 'sid' to activity and summarize it\n",
        "activity[\"sid\"] = activity[\"student_id\"].str.replace(\"NU-\", \"\").astype(int)\n",
        "activity_summary = activity.groupby(\"sid\")[[\"lms_clicks\", \"minutes_active\"]].sum().reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "# TODO: build the standardized key and the one-row-per-student \"analysis\" table\n",
        "analysis = students_dedup.merge(\n",
        "    activity_summary,\n",
        "    on=\"sid\",\n",
        "    how=\"left\"\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "30484931",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "30484931"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# ✅ Check\n",
        "try:\n",
