        "### C7 · Parse the dates\n",
        "Parse `enrollment_date` so no valid date is lost. Store the parsed series as **`dates_parsed`** and check the number of NaT (blanks).\n",
        "*Hint:* `pd.to_datetime(..., format=\"mixed\", errors=\"coerce\")` — compare NaT before and after."
